                                "sense_id": "b6fd1f2e-63b1-320e-be36-03910630c941",
                                "text": "1977-1980, Lou Sullivan, personal diary, quoted in 2019, Ellis Martin, Zach Ozma (editors), We Both Laughed In Pleasure\nFour big hippie bikers were out there drinking & eyeing up the punkers."
                            },
