                                "sense_id": "b6fd1f2e-63b1-320e-be36-03910630c941",
                                "text": "And famous punker Joe Strummer figures prominently in Mercury's life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "660b9c04-a01c-4dd6-b22a-a77c19c3cd45",
                                "sense_id": "b6fd1f2e-63b1-320e-be36-03910630c941",
                                "text": "She was a crack-up, she thought she was such a punker. She always had some punk group on her headset."
